" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,9)\">Isa 44:9</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> of <highlight>human activity:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> of a potter who forms out of clay a vessel <ref ref=\"Isa 29:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,29,16)\">Isa 29:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 41:25\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(23,41,25)\">Isa 41:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 18:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,18,4)\">Jer 18:4</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Jer 18:6\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(24,18,6)\">Jer 18:6</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"1Chr 4:23\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(13,4,23)\">1Chr 4:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lam 4:2\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(25,4,2)\">Lam 4:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 11:13\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(38,11,13)\">Zech 11:13</ref> (twice in verse) (these last two according to <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Thes')\">Thes</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('SS')\">SS</lookup> et al. error for <bdbheb>אוֺצָר</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כְּלִי (ה)י</bdbheb> <highlight>potter's vessel</highlight> <ref ref=\"2Sam 17:28\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(10,17,28)\">2Sam 17:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 2:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,2,9)\">Ps 2:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 19:11\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(24,19,11)\">Jer 19:11</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>חֹמֶר הי</bdbheb> <highlight>potter's clay</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 29:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,29,16)\">Isa 29:16</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נֵבֶל י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 30:14\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(23,30,14)\">Isa 30:14</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בַּקְבֻּק י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 19:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,19,1)\">Jer 19:1</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בית הי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 18:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,18,2)\">Jer 18:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 18:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(24,18,3)\">Jer 18:3</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> of a carver of wood, graven images <ref ref=\"Isa 44:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,9)\">Isa 44:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 44:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,10)\">Isa 44:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 44:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,12)\">Isa 44:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hab 2:18\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(35,2,18)\">Hab 2:18</ref> (twice in verse). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <highlight>frame, devise</highlight> in the mind <bdbheb>עָמָל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 94:20\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"94\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"94\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(19,94,20)\">Ps 94:20</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> of <highlight>divine activity:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> (as a potter) forming Adam out of <bdbheb>עפר</bdbheb> from <bdbheb>אדמה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 2:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,2,7)\">Gen 2:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 2:8\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(1,2,8)\">Gen 2:8</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), beasts and birds, also from <bdbheb>אדמה</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Gen 2:19\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(1,2,19)\">Gen 2:19</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>); Israel as a people <ref ref=\"Isa 27:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,27,11)\">Isa 27:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 43:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,43,1)\">Isa 43:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 43:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,43,21)\">Isa 43:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 44:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,21)\">Isa 44:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 45:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,9)\">Isa 45:9</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Isa 45:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,11)\">Isa 45:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 64:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"64\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"64\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,64,7)\">Isa 64:7</ref>, even from the womb <ref ref=\"Isa 44:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,2)\">Isa 44:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 44:24\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,24)\">Isa 44:24</ref> the servant of Yahweh from the womb <ref ref=\"Isa 49:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,49,5)\">Isa 49:5</ref> of the formation of the individual man <ref ref=\"Isa 43:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,43,7)\">Isa 43:7</ref> Jeremiah in the womb <ref ref=\"Jer 1:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,1,5)\">Jer 1:5</ref> the eye of man <ref ref=\"Ps 94:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"94\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"94\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,94,9)\">Ps 94:9</ref> the locust <ref ref=\"Amos 7:1\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(30,7,1)\">Amos 7:1</ref> Leviathan <ref ref=\"Ps 104:26\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"104\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"104\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(19,104,26)\">Ps 104:26</ref> the dry land <ref ref=\"Ps 95:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"95\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"95\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,95,5)\">Ps 95:5</ref> the earth <ref ref=\"Isa 45:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,18)\">Isa 45:18</ref> (twice in verse); the mountains <ref ref=\"Amos 4:13\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(30,4,13)\">Amos 4:13</ref> <bdbheb>הַכֹּל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 10:16\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(24,10,16)\">Jer 10:16</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 51:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,19)\">Jer 51:19</ref>. Figurative perhaps lost sight of in some of the above, and quite certainly in the forming of light <ref ref=\"Isa 45:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,7)\">Isa 45:7</ref>, of summer and winter <ref ref=\"Ps 74:17\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"74\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"74\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(19,74,17)\">Ps 74:17</ref>, the <bdbheb>רוּחַ</bdbheb> of man <ref ref=\"Zech 12:1\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(38,12,1)\">Zech 12:1</ref>, and the <bdbheb>לב</bdbheb> of men <ref ref=\"Ps 33:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,33,15)\">Ps 33:15</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> figurative for <highlight>frame, pre-ordain, plan</highlight> (in divine purpose), of a situation <bdbheb>מֵרָחוֺק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 22:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,22,11)\">Isa 22:11</ref> of an occurrence <bdbheb>מִימֵי קֶדֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 37:26\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(23,37,26)\">Isa 37:26</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Kgs 19:25\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(12,19,25)\">2Kgs 19:25</ref> <bdbheb>יָצַרְתִּי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>אַף אֶעֱשֶׂנָּה</bdbheb> <highlight>I have planned, I will also do it</highlight> <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"2Kgs 46:11\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(12,46,11)\">2Kgs 46:11</ref> <bdbheb>רעה על</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 18:11\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(24,18,11)\">Jer 18:11</ref> <bdbheb>לַהֲכִינָהּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <highlight>devised it to establish it</highlight> <ref ref=\"Jer 33:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,33,2)\">Jer 33:2</ref>. <b>Niph`al</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>לְפָנַי לֹאנֿוֺצַר אֵל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 43:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,43,10)\">Isa 43:10</ref> <highlight>before me a god was not formed</highlight> (created). <b>Pu`al</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יָמִים יצָֻּ֑רוּ</bdbheb> <highlight>days</highlight> (that) <highlight>were pre-ordained</highlight> (in the divine purpose) <ref ref=\"Ps 139:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"139\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"139\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,139,16)\">Ps 139:16</ref> (compare <b>Qal, 2 b</b>). <b>Hoph`al</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>כָּלכְּֿלִי יוּצַר עָלַיִךְ לֹא יִצְלָ֑ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 54:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"54\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"54\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,54,17)\">Isa 54:17</ref> <highlight>any weapon that is formed against thee will not prosper</highlight>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Isa 44:10", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 44, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Gen 2:8", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 2, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Isa 45:18", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 45, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "